            [
              123.0,
              402.0
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "From the geometry in Figure 29.3a, we can see that the angle between the vectors  $ d\\vec{s} $ and  $ \\vec{r} $ is  $ \\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2} - \\theta\\right) $ radians.",
